a "deck" is a viewable list of cards -- a deck of playing cards
	when creating a deck
		// Create one of each card, ace of clubs first
		for rank in card ranks
			for suit in card suits
				add a new card with rank and suit to the deck
	its "shorthand" is -- its card names, top to bottom
		set card names to a new list of text
		for card in the deck
			add the shorthand of the card to card names
		return "deck: " + card names

	to test a new deck
		the deck is a new deck
		the number of cards in the deck should be 52
		the number of (cards in the deck where it is a queen) should be 4
		deck's first card's shorthand should be "A♣↓"
		deck's last card's name should be "king of spades"
		shuffle the deck
		the number of cards in the deck should be 52
